world  corrected four ball cascade

-- All bodies start with zero velocity.
-- MuJoCo's default gravity is used.
-- All moving hinges use 0.04 N·m·s/rad damping.
-- The carts use physical horizontal guides and spring-assisted pushers.
-- Exact slide damping and numeric restitution are unavailable in this language.
-- Ring1 is enlarged so the rigid 12 cm cube can pass through it.

floor
  size      12 m
  friction  0.68, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

